# Crystal Fragments: "{5}{W}{W}: Exile this Equipment, then return it to the battlefield transformed under its owner's control" (CR 712.14a) makes Summon: Alexander, a 4/3 white Saga creature with flying that enters with a lore counter, so chapter I (CR 714.3a) prevents all damage that would be dealt to creatures Bot1 controls this turn. On turn 3 Bot1 pays the seven mana with Black Lotus and its other mana sources, and a Lightning Bolt at its own Alexander (3 damage to a 4/3) is prevented.

